    <span class="eyebrow">Case Study</span>
    <h1>She was working harder and earning <em>less</em> for it.</h1>
    <p class="sub">How a LinkedIn brand strategist replaced guesswork pricing with a system, and grew her monthly income by 40 percent.</p>

